Package: wordchecker
Title: Analyze text based on positive and negative words
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Hanna", "Wieslander", , "hanna.wieslander@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Identifies positive and negative words in a text by comparing them with predefined word lists. Calculates the ratio between positive and negative words and provides the absolute number of words in each category.
